	(text_box "Three independent quadrature encoders. The first eight 5 V push-pull A/B/Z outputs feed U28, an SN74AHCT541 powered at 3.3 V. ENC2_Z uses only a 5.1 k series / 10 k shunt divider, which is sufficient for this single input and avoids a second 20-pin buffer. No ESD array is fitted."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 15 0.0000)
		(size 190 35)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
